                <mxCell id="failresult" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#dc2626;fillColor=#fee2e2;fontColor=#0f172a;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:8px&quot;&gt;No: report validation failure&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;Linearization illegal/timeout â†’ skip watch and serializable checks so they do not hide the first failure. Preserve report for investigation.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
